"text":"Despite insisting that she wants to remain faithful to her marriage, Mariko’s actions tell another story. When her husband confronts her, she reveals the truth. At least, she says it’s the truth..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Game 1:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yasushi's wife, who works for a certain company as a temporary employee. Although she usually hides her figure under a suit, she has a figure that puts models to shame. She has a bit of a natural, carefree personality that makes those around her feel warm and fuzzy. Her only sexual experience with men is with Yasushi. She was satisfied with their loving sex life. Or so she thought."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from at-sakura.net"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Game 2:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mariko previously worked as a temporary worker but resigned, and is now employed as a writer at a mid-sized publishing company. She writes introduction articles for adult games with her face shown, and has a large male fan base. She keeps her marriage secret from the public. She has a history of having an affair with her superior. Despite her intelligent and refined appearance, she has a very strong sex drive. She also longs for the kind of intense, all-night sex she used to have in the past."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from at-sakura.net"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44936"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"康の妻で、派遣で某企業で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はスーツの下に隠れているが、モデル顔負けのスタイルの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し天然が入っていて、周囲の人をほんわかした気持ちにさせてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性経験は康のみ。愛あるエッチに満足していた。筈だった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8877","sourceWorkId":"16782","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妻で、派遣で某企業で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はスーツの下に隠れているが、モデル顔負けのスタイルの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し天然が入っていて、周囲の人をほんわかした気持ちにさせてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性経験は夫のみ。愛あるエッチに満足していた…筈だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text"